# The first IN-BAND strike arm ([[impossible-economy-problem]] class 3):
# imptr12 measured the momentum signal's range at Impossible as
# 2,900-7,950 per-match max, so strike 2500 is a release window that
# opens in EVERY match with real dwell time -- unlike the 5000/15000
# arms, which barely or never fired. Everything else is flame-nocover.

name imp-strike2500
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
